# Same policy as Fotox: text files are LF in the repository and in the working
# tree (core.autocrlf would otherwise rewrite them on Windows), Windows scripts
# keep CRLF, and the binary formats are left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.psd binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
